{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "cvhome-edge",
  "title": "Edge: spg & landing-ui",
  "description": "The shopper-facing edge: the pod gateway (spg) per route and the storefront (landing-ui) page renders and their upstream calls. Built from the spans, since neither runs Micrometer.",
